  "slug": "climate-nature-and-a-fairer-wales",
  "title": "Climate, Nature and a Fairer Wales - Cross Party Group",
  "purpose": "To build cross-party understanding, leadership, and action for the climate and nature emergencies in ways that tackle Wales's most pressing social and economic challenges. The group will provide a collaborative forum for Members of the Senedd to engage with evidence, practitioners, and communities. By de-siloing environmental policy, the group will demonstrate how climate and nature action can directly reduce the cost of living, address economic inequality, improve public health, and foster community cohesion. Through constructive, cross-party dialogue, the group aims to strengthen Senedd scrutiny, inform policy development, and help deliver a fairer, healthier, and more resilient Wales.",
